{"seq":1,"slug":"ingredients-materials","title":"材料与品质","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-crafting-systems/recipes/ingredients-materials","wordCount":1488,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"材料与品质\">材料与品质</h1><p>一把剑好不好,一半取决于配方,另一半取决于打它的是废铁还是精钢。材料是合成系统的物质起点,而材料的<strong>品质</strong>是整个系统手感的源头——它让「同样一条配方」能产出天差地别的结果,是玩家愿意去深山采稀有矿、去精心挑选原料的根本动力。这一篇是全 hub 唯一系统定义材料分类与品质等级的地方;后续凡是提到「品质」的篇章,都指回这里的定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-材料的四层分类\">核心概念：材料的四层分类</h2><p>把材料无差别地当成一堆 id,系统会很快失控。按它们在合成链条中的角色分层,能让配方设计和经济平衡都清晰起来。</p>\n<p><strong>原料(raw)</strong>:直接从世界获取,不经加工。矿石、木头、兽皮、草药。它们是整条链条的入口,产量由采集/掉落决定。</p>\n<p><strong>精炼物(refined)</strong>:原料经过一次加工的中间产物。铁锭(铁矿→铁锭)、木板、皮革。它们几乎不直接使用,主要作为更高级配方的输入,是依赖图的中间层。</p>\n<p><strong>组件(component)</strong>:半成品,已经接近功能。剑刃、剑柄、齿轮。组件常常本身也需要合成,是配方树深度的主要来源。</p>\n<p><strong>催化物(catalyst)</strong>:参与但不(或很少)构成产物主体的特殊材料——附魔用的魔法尘、提升成功率的助熔剂。它们常与随机品质和熟练度系统挂钩。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分类</th>\n<th>来源</th>\n<th>是否直接可用</th>\n<th>在依赖图中的位置</th>\n<th>经济角色</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>原料 raw</td>\n<td>采集/掉落</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>叶节点(入口)</td>\n<td>主要水龙头</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>精炼物 refined</td>\n<td>一次加工</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>中间层</td>\n<td>加工增值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>组件 component</td>\n<td>多步合成</td>\n<td>部分</td>\n<td>中间/次顶层</td>\n<td>深度来源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>催化物 catalyst</td>\n<td>稀有掉落/购买</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>旁路输入</td>\n<td>稀缺调节阀</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"品质等级-离散还是连续\">品质等级:离散还是连续</h2><p>品质需要一套刻度。主流有两种建模方式,选择直接影响玩家感知和系统复杂度。</p>\n<p><strong>离散等级</strong>:粗糙 / 普通 / 优良 / 精良 / 传说,通常 4–7 档,常与颜色绑定(白绿蓝紫橙)。它直观、易沟通、易在 UI 展示,是绝大多数游戏的选择。离散等级和物品稀有度是同一套视觉语言,稀有度的分层设计详见<a href=\"../../game-loot-tables-drops/sampling/rarity-tiers\">库存与掉落物的稀有度分层</a>。</p>\n<p><strong>连续品质值</strong>:品质是一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>100</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0, 100]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0, 1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 的浮点数,产物属性随它平滑缩放。它更细腻,能表达「99 分的精钢」和「100 分的完美精钢」之间的微妙差异(《星露谷物语》的作物星级、《怪物猎人》的锋利度接近此类),但对玩家的沟通成本更高,通常会在 UI 上再映射回几档标签。</p>\n<p>很多成熟系统是<strong>混合</strong>的:内部用连续值参与计算,展示时按阈值映射成离散等级。这样既有计算的细腻,又有沟通的清晰。</p>\n<h2 id=\"品质如何从材料流入产物\">品质如何从材料流入产物</h2><p>材料品质要真正有意义,必须能传导到产物。这里的设计是「材料品质」与「产物品质」之间的函数关系。最常见的三种传导方式:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>加权平均</strong>:产物品质 = 各输入材料品质的加权平均。用精钢(<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>90</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q=90</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">90</span></span></span></span></span>)和普通皮革(<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q=50</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span></span></span></span></span>)造剑,产物品质落在两者之间。</li>\n<li><strong>短板决定</strong>:产物品质取所有输入的最小值——一条链条上最差的材料决定成品上限,鼓励玩家全程用好料。</li>\n<li><strong>主料决定</strong>:只有关键材料(剑刃的钢)决定品质,次要材料(柄、缠绳)不影响。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>以加权平均为例,若产物品质 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 种材料的品质 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 决定:</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q = \\frac{\\sum_{i=1}^{n} w_i \\, q_i}{\\sum_{i=1}^{n} w_i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.488em;vertical-align:-0.994em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.494em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3057em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8043em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6897em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8043em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.994em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>注意:这里算的是品质的<strong>基准值</strong>。真正落到玩家手里的产物品质,还要叠加合成时的随机 roll 和玩家熟练度——那属于<a href=\"output-quality\">产出与随机品质</a>的范畴,本篇只负责定义材料侧的品质基准,不重复展开随机部分。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[原料 raw&lt;br/&gt;矿石/木头/兽皮] --&gt;|采集掉落| B[精炼物 refined&lt;br/&gt;铁锭/木板/皮革]&#10;  B --&gt; C[组件 component&lt;br/&gt;剑刃/剑柄]&#10;  D[催化物 catalyst&lt;br/&gt;助熔剂] -.旁路.-&gt; E&#10;  C --&gt; E[产物&lt;br/&gt;品质基准 = f 各输入品质]&#10;  A --&gt;|品质| E&#10;  E --&gt;|再叠加随机+熟练度| F[最终产物品质]\">flowchart TD\n  A[原料 raw&lt;br/&gt;矿石/木头/兽皮] --&gt;|采集掉落| B[精炼物 refined&lt;br/&gt;铁锭/木板/皮革]\n  B --&gt; C[组件 component&lt;br/&gt;剑刃/剑柄]\n  D[催化物 catalyst&lt;br/&gt;助熔剂] -.旁路.-&gt; E\n  C --&gt; E[产物&lt;br/&gt;品质基准 = f 各输入品质]\n  A --&gt;|品质| E\n  E --&gt;|再叠加随机+熟练度| F[最终产物品质]</pre><h2 id=\"材料稀缺性与经济张力\">材料稀缺性与经济张力</h2><p>材料的品质分布不能是均匀的——如果精钢和废铁一样好拿,品质就失去了意义。设计上,高品质材料应当更稀缺:更深的矿层、更强的怪物掉落、更低的采集概率。这种稀缺性正是合成经济张力的来源,它决定了「造一件传说装备的真实成本」。稀缺性如何转化为经济水槽,详见<a href=\"../practice/crafting-economy\">合成与经济平衡</a>;而材料从掉落进入系统的产量控制,与掉落表的掉率设计同源,见<a href=\"../../game-loot-tables-drops/foundations/why-loot-tables\">掉落表与掉率</a>。</p>\n<p>催化物是调节这种张力的精妙工具:一份稀有助熔剂能把普通材料的产物品质拉高一档,于是玩家在「用稀有材料」和「用稀有催化物+普通材料」之间有了策略取舍——这正是表达价值的体现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>材料按角色分四层:原料(入口)、精炼物(中间)、组件(深度)、催化物(调节阀)。</li>\n<li>品质有离散等级(直观易沟通)和连续值(细腻)两种建模,成熟系统常混合:内部连续、展示离散。</li>\n<li>材料品质通过加权平均/短板/主料三种方式传导到产物,本篇定义品质基准 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>随机 roll 与熟练度对品质的进一步影响,交给产出篇,本篇不重复。</li>\n<li>高品质材料必须更稀缺,这是合成经济张力的物质来源。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同 hub:<a href=\"output-quality\">产出与随机品质</a>——在品质基准上叠加随机与熟练度。</li>\n<li>同 hub:<a href=\"crafting-graph\">合成依赖图</a>——四层材料如何织成加工链。</li>\n<li>跨 hub:<a href=\"../../game-loot-tables-drops/sampling/rarity-tiers\">掉落表与掉率 · 稀有度分层</a>——品质等级与稀有度的共用视觉语言。</li>\n<li>跨 hub:<a href=\"../../inventory-loot-itemization/foundations/item-data-model\">库存与掉落物 · 物品数据模型</a>——材料作为物品实例的存储。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"材料与品质","id":"材料与品质"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：材料的四层分类","id":"核心概念-材料的四层分类"},{"level":2,"text":"品质等级:离散还是连续","id":"品质等级-离散还是连续"},{"level":2,"text":"品质如何从材料流入产物","id":"品质如何从材料流入产物"},{"level":2,"text":"材料稀缺性与经济张力","id":"材料稀缺性与经济张力"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"配方数据模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-crafting-systems/foundations/crafting-model"},"next":{"title":"合成依赖图","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-crafting-systems/recipes/crafting-graph"}}